10 REM Ball bounce demo, windowed .bas app (see bounce.app.toml)
20 REM Uses CIRCLE and PRESENT (fmruby extensions), CLS, PAUSE
30 X=80
40 Y=50
50 DX=1
60 DY=1
70 R=5
80 W=190
90 H=130
100 CLS
110 CIRCLE X,Y,R,224
120 PRESENT
130 PAUSE 2
140 X=X+DX
150 Y=Y+DY
160 IF X>W THEN DX=-DX
170 IF X<R THEN DX=-DX
180 IF Y>H THEN DY=-DY
190 IF Y<R THEN DY=-DY
200 GOTO 100
